  << /ActualText (experience\nSenior Product Designer \057 Agilysys\nMarch 2024 \055 Present\nDesigned an end\055to\055end booking flow to simplify complex individual and group scheduling\054 contributing to retaining high\055profile clients\056\nBuilt the company\031s first scalable design system \0500\2221\051 across two major products\054 defining components\054 documentation\054 and engineering\055aligned standards\054 resulting in reduced handoff friction and improved delivery consistency at scale\056\nPartnered with PM and CS leadership to identify and make a compelling case for product improvements\054 connecting customer research and business metrics to design decisions that influenced roadmap priorities\056\nUsed AI tools to speed up research\054 prototype A\057B test variants\054 and build handoff\055ready prototypes\054 vetting for technical accuracy\056\nMentored designers through structured critique and cross\055team standards\054 modelling best practices and proactively improving team processes and design quality\056\n\nSenior Product Designer \057 Rogers Communications\nJuly 2020 \055 August 2023\nIncreased average traffic to Rogers Business B2B platform by 312\045 and CTR by 235\045 by redesigning user workflows and iterating on designs based on data\054 A\057B testing\054 and user research\056\nAccelerated design team throughput by implementing a cohesive design system integrated with the wider Rogers digital ecosystem\056\nDesigned end\055to\055end flows for both B2B and B2C customers \050e\056g\056 multi\055line purchasing and new customer registration\051\054 mapping dependencies across interconnected flows to resolve technical constraints and reduce funnel drop\055off\056\n\nProduct Designer \057 Furnishr\nSeptember 2018 \055 August 2019\nBuilt internal workflow tooling that improved operational efficiency by 12\045 through better Design Ops and backlog prioritization\056\nEstablished high\055fidelity prototyping standards and cohesive style guides that modernized the product\047s visual language and reduced drop\055off rates by 20\045\056)
